sections: INPUT, OUTPUT, COMMENTS, STAMPS!!
{
	!! FOOP-55 D9 (docs/foop/FOOP-55.md) — a recoordinated SFF-marked index
	!! search, once found by an unanchored name search inside a
	!! concatenation, must be re-stepped in its NEW context (c's) rather
	!! than kept frozen in the ECONSTANIC state it settled to at its
	!! ORIGINAL definition site (b's).
	!! a  = {1,2}                     -- a two-statement brane
	!! b  = <<#-2>>                   -- SFF-marked index, ECONSTANIC where
	!!                                   written (nothing two-back from a
	!!                                   top-level statement)
	!! c  = a b                       -- concatenation: ?b finds b, and the
	!!                                   found body (the #-2 search) is
	!!                                   constanic-cloned and recoordinated
	!!                                   into c's own context, where #-2 now
	!!                                   has a real target (a, two back from
	!!                                   b's position in c) and should run.
	!! @agent NOTE (2026-08-26): `c` currently stalls at WOCONSTANIC instead
	!! of settling CONSTANT to the flattened {1,2,1,2} FOOP-55's own D9
	!! "Correction" section predicts. Root cause (live-traced, not yet
	!! fixed): a `has_ancestral_sfm` scope-propagation leak in `step_inner`
	!! (foolish-ubca/src/fir_trait.rs) — see docs/foop/FOOP-55.plan.md's
	!! Phase 3I and the pinned unit test
	!! `fir_kinds::tests::d9_recoordinated_index_currently_stuck_woconstanic`.
	!! This OUTPUT is the CURRENT BROKEN result, not the correct one — do
	!! not treat this baseline as a spec to preserve. Once Phase 3I lands,
	!! re-run, confirm `c` now settles to {1,2,1,2}, remove this note, and
	!! promote the corrected output.
	a = {1,2};
	b = <<#-2>>;
	c = a b;
}
!!
{WOCONSTANIC
  a={
      1;
      2
  };
  b=<<WOCONSTANIC
      #(offset=-2, UNANCHORED, ECONSTANIC)
  >>;
  c=⨃(
      elements=2,
      ?(
  result={
      1;
      2
  },
  pattern='^a$',
  UNANCHORED
),
      <ECONSTANIC
  ?(result=#(offset=-2, UNANCHORED, ECONSTANIC), pattern='^b$', UNANCHORED, WOCONSTANIC)
>,
      WOCONSTANIC
  )
}!!
!!
